27;Callie, isn&#x27;t there gonna be one left over? There is a final holo money at the end, but for now... Alright, here we go.&#x27;</p>\n<h2>The Game Participants</h2>\n<p>The participants in the game are Subaru, Marin, Watame, and Azuki. This was confirmed by the participants, who said, &#x27;one. Now I know Subaru. I&#x27;ll just say, Subaru, Marin, Watame, and...&#x27;</p>\n<p>The game involves a final holo money round. This was confirmed by the participants, who said, &#x27;I&#x27;ll just say, Subaru, Marin, Watame, and... Azuki.&#x27;</p>\n<p>Flare, Gura, Okayu, and Koyori are involved in the game. This was confirmed by the participants, who said, &#x27;and... Azuki. The answer is Flare, Gura, Okayu, and Koyori.&#x27;</p>\n<p>A duck is a key element of the game. This was confirmed by the participants, who said, &#x27;Azuki. The answer is Flare, Gura, Okayu, and Koyori. It&#x27;s a duck!&#x27;</p>\n<p>Players must quickly respond to questions to buzz in. This was confirmed by the participants, who said, &#x27;The answer is Flare, Gura, Okayu, and Koyori. It&#x27;s a duck!&#x27;</p>\n<p>Speed is crucial for participation. This was confirmed by the participants, who said, &#x27;Okayu, and Koyori. It&#x27;s a duck! Who&#x27;s quacking?&#x27;</p>\n<p>A question is posed about who is &#x27;quacking&#x27;. This was confirmed by the participants, who said, &#x27;Who&#x27;s quacking? She&#x27;s throwing you off! She was throwing you off.&#x27;</p>\n<p>Someone is attempting to mislead the others. This was confirmed by the participants, who said, &#x27;She&#x27;s throwing you off! She was throwing you off. Classic. Alright.&#x27;</p>\n<h2>記事情報</h2>\n<p>https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=gYEsfr1Y-CI</p>",
